  "content": "[![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/slabfish_plush.png)](https://slabfi.sh/makeship)\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/banner/woodworks.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/blueprint\"><img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/blueprint\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh\"><img alt=\"Website\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/website\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/discord\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/discord\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/x\"><img alt=\"X\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/x\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/patreon\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://slabfi.sh/shield/patreon\"></a>\n</p>\n\n### 📖 Описание:\nДобавляет Лесопилку — блок, похожий на камнерез, но для древесных вариантов. Также вводит разновидности лестниц, ульев, сундуков, запертых сундуков, книжных полок и резных книжных полок, а также доски и кучи листьев! В отличие от большинства наших модов, этот мод полностью настраиваемый, то есть все его функции можно включать или выключать в конфигурационном файле!\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/blueprint\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/blueprint.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/abnormals_delight\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/abnormals_delight.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/allurement\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/allurement.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/atmospheric\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/atmospheric.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/autumnity\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/autumnity.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/berry_good\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/berry_good.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/boatload\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/boatload.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/buzzier_bees\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/buzzier_bees.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/caverns_and_chasms\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/caverns_and_chasms.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/clayworks\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/clayworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/endergetic\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/endergetic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/environmental\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/environmental.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/gallery\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/gallery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/incubation\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/incubation.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/neapolitan\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/neapolitan.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/personality\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/personality.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/pet_cemetery\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/pet_cemetery.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/savage_and_ravage\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/savage_and_ravage.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/upgrade_aquatic\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/upgrade_aquatic.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://slabfi.sh/mr/woodworks\"><img src=\"https://i.slabfi.sh/icon_crop/woodworks.png\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\"></a>\n</p>\n\n![](https://i.slabfi.sh/web/divider.png)\n\n[![